            "mailing address, no URL, no email address, and no trailing clause such as "
            "', a joint fundraising committee composed of ...' or 'Not authorized by any candidate'.\n"
            "2. Keep legal suffixes that are part of the name (Inc., LLC, JFC).\n"
            "3. If the disclaimer is written in ALL CAPS, convert it to normal title case "
            "(lowercase small words like for, of, the, and), but keep genuine acronyms "
            "(GOP, PAC, JFC, RNC, DNC, NRSC) capitalized.\n"
            "4. Line wrapping may have glued words together (e.g. two words with no space between "
